<title>POLAND: PBR, BPH, Warta, Kredyt bid to buy Polish PBK bank.</title>
<headline>PBR, BPH, Warta, Kredyt bid to buy Polish PBK bank.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group of three Polish banks and an insurance company are bidding to buy a controlling stake in the state-owned commercial Powszechny Bank Kredytowy SA, one of the banks of the consortium said in a Wednesday statement.</p>
</text>
